From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Paul Praschl <praschlpaul@g-p.at>
Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 17:17:31 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 065/117] dt-bindings: input: apple,z2: add D111 touchscreen
 properties

D111 uses the Apple Z2 touchscreen protocol but differs from the existing
J172 and Touch Bar integrations. It consumes separate core and
high-voltage supplies and its firmware requests four device-specific
calibration payloads supplied by the bootloader.

Add the D111 compatible, model the two rails as regulator supplies and
describe the additional orb-gap, orb-force and shape-acceleration
calibration byte arrays alongside the existing multitouch calibration.
Require the D111 clock, supplies, SPI mode and no-initial-ack property.

The calibration blobs are intentionally not required in the static board
DTS because they are per-device data injected by the bootloader; the
driver validates them before probe. Standard clock, regulator, SPI and
firmware properties cover the hardware, so no input- or SPI-core special
interface is introduced. The binding passed dt-doc-validate and the built
D111 DTB passed apple,z2-multitouch schema validation with dtschema
2026.6. This patch was checked with checkpatch.pl --strict.

Signed-off-by: Paul Praschl <praschlpaul@g-p.at>

Orchard-replay-of: de8e0cd546991de38d73cb546d85aad11e1570a2
---
 .../touchscreen/apple,z2-multitouch.yaml      | 37 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 37 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/touchscreen/apple,z2-multitouch.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/touchscreen/apple,z2-multitouch.yaml
index 5422771de..078fcaf80 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/touchscreen/apple,z2-multitouch.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/touchscreen/apple,z2-multitouch.yaml
@@ -18,6 +18,7 @@ properties:
       - apple,j293-touchbar
       - apple,j493-touchbar
       - apple,j172-touchscreen
+      - apple,d111-touchscreen
 
   interrupts:
     maxItems: 1
@@ -31,6 +32,12 @@ properties:
   power-ldo-gpios:
     maxItems: 1
 
+  hv-supply:
+    description: High-voltage analog supply for the touchscreen controller
+
+  core-supply:
+    description: Core supply for the touchscreen controller
+
   display-sync-gpios:
     maxItems: 1
 
@@ -65,6 +72,24 @@ properties:
     description:
       Calibration blob supplied by the bootloader
 
+  apple,z2-orb-gap-cal-blob:
+    $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/uint8-array
+    maxItems: 4096
+    description:
+      Orb gap calibration blob supplied by the bootloader
+
+  apple,z2-orb-force-cal-blob:
+    $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/uint8-array
+    maxItems: 4096
+    description:
+      Orb force calibration blob supplied by the bootloader
+
+  apple,z2-shape-accel-cal-blob:
+    $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/uint8-array
+    maxItems: 4096
+    description:
+      Dynamic shape acceleration calibration blob supplied by the bootloader
+
 required:
   - compatible
   - interrupts
@@ -96,6 +121,18 @@ allOf:
         - spi-cpol
         - apple,z2-bpw16-min-len
         - apple,z2-no-init-ack
+  - if:
+      properties:
+        compatible:
+          const: apple,d111-touchscreen
+    then:
+      required:
+        - clocks
+        - hv-supply
+        - core-supply
+        - spi-cpha
+        - spi-cpol
+        - apple,z2-no-init-ack
 
 unevaluatedProperties: false
 
